PHP Poker ships the following third-party art and type. Everything else in this package is original work
under the package LICENSE.

Card faces: art/cards/deck.svg
  "Public domain complete playing card deck" from Wikimedia Commons. Released into the public domain (CC0).
  Rasterised in the browser at boot; the SVG is shipped unchanged.

Card backs: art/cards/back-red.svg, art/cards/back-blue.svg
  "Tiled red/blue broken line rhombus card back" from Wikimedia Commons. Public domain.

Type: art/typography/barlow-semi-condensed.json (extracted outlines)
  Barlow Semi Condensed by Jeremy Tribby, SIL Open Font License 1.1. See art/typography/OFL.txt.
  The generated atlas assets/generated/ui-font.* derive from these outlines; the OFL ships beside them.

Type: art/typography/fixedsys-excelsior.json (extracted outlines)
  Fixedsys Excelsior 3.02 by Darien Valentine, with ligature work by Kirill Pertsev (github.com/kika/fixedsys).
  Released to the public domain; CC0 where that is not permitted. See art/typography/fixedsys-excelsior-LICENSE.md.
  Used for the Classic look only.

Player emblems: art/icons/*.svg
  Pixel art icons by Pxlkit (https://pxlkit.xyz), rendered from the @pxlkit/gamification and @pxlkit/feedback
  pack data at 4x and recoloured per player by scripts/import-pxlkit-icons.mjs. Pxlkit Asset License: free with the
  visible credit "Icons by Pxlkit" and a link to https://pxlkit.xyz, which the game shows on its menu. See
  art/icons/LICENSE-ASSETS and art/icons/roster.json for the icon each player uses.
